{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":33,"alongside":37,"kin":42,"engines":67,"usedOn":68,"sites":69,"crewed":75,"museums":76,"hero":77},null,{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_missions":28,"linked_sites":29,"tagline":13,"description":32},"phoenix","Phoenix","lander","NASA","USA","Lockheed Martin","2008-05-25","RETIRED","1981-2011","iss-assembly","マルティアン土壌で水氷を確認","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Phoenix — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Phoenix_(spacecraft)","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Phoenix Mars Mission — NASA","https://mars.nasa.gov/mars-exploration/missions/phoenix/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Phoenix Mission Profile (NASA)","https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-phoenix/","deep",[3],[30],{"type":31,"site_id":3},"mars","Phoenixは、米国のLockheed Martinが造った惑星着陸機です。火星の土壌に水の氷があることを確認しました。2008年にミッションを終了しました。",[34],{"id":3,"name":4,"first":35,"year":36},"火星北極域のレゴリスで水氷を初めて確認；Viking 2以来初の、逆噴射による火星軟着陸",2007,[38],{"id":39,"name":40,"tagline":41},"delta-ii","Delta II","NASAの中型惑星科学の主力機 — 1989〜2018年に155回の打ち上げ",[43,47,51,55,59,63],{"id":44,"name":45,"tagline":46},"mars-polar-lander","Mars Polar Lander","1999年の着陸時に喪失。この失敗でNASAは「より速く、より良く、より安く」路線を見直した",{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"insight","InSight","火星の地震計、1300回超の火星地震を検出",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"viking-1","Viking 1","火星着陸に初めて成功した着陸機。生物学実験を実施",{"id":56,"name":57,"tagline":58},"viking2-lander","Viking 2 Lander","米国2機目の火星着陸機（ユートピア平原、1976-09-03）。Viking 1着陸機の双子で、1980年まで生物学・土壌化学・気象の観測を実施",{"id":60,"name":61,"tagline":62},"surveyor-3","Surveyor 3","Apollo 12が2.5年後に訪れた",{"id":64,"name":65,"tagline":66},"change-3","Chang'e 3","最初の中国の月面着陸船",[],[],[70],{"type":31,"href":71,"name":72,"place":73,"text":74},"/mars/phoenix","Phoenix 着陸機","ボレアリス荒野（北極平原）","火星の水氷に初めて物理的に接触した宇宙機。Phoenix のロボットアームがすくった氷が数時間で昇華する様子をカメラが捉えた — 軌道上のMars Odyssey中性子分光が推定した地下氷の直接的視覚確認。北半球の冬で太陽電池が凍るまで 157 sol 稼働。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/phoenix/03.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
